### List all messages
GET http://localhost:3000/messages

### Create a new message
POST http://localhost:3000/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "yo"
}


### Get a message by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/messages/da1bqj 


### Get all US states
GET http://localhost:3000/ai/states

### Get all US states abbreviations
GET http://localhost:3000/ai/states-abbreviations

### Get user list
GET http://localhost:3000/ai/users

### Get kpi data
GET http://localhost:3000/ai/kpi-data

### Get Response from AI
POST http://localhost:3000/ai/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "What is the weather in new york?"
}
